est?cb=20210420180850&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cublarc_the_Plunderer_efbd6f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Cublarc the Plunderer.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Orc arga Huummmak!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Appears during <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Raids\">raids on Zzaion</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Raids\">the steppe</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"de2a0683ebdcab55cb575af65a0c6498\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Cublarc_possible_location-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px; top:19.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cublarc_possible_location_470cc3.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Cublarc possible location.png (986 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Cublarc_The_Plunderer_for_Tibia_Wiki-JPG\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:151px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cublarc_The_Plunderer_for_Tibia_Wiki_b86569.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Cublarc The Plunderer for Tibia Wiki.JPG (21 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wi