-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">120%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Spawns randomly <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33247,31403,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33247, 31403, 7)</a> and during 3 different raids:\n</p>\n<ul><li>When orcs are invading <a href=\"#/wiki/Zzaion\">Zzaion</a>, it spawns near the gate.</li>\n<li>During the Orc raid at the steppe, it spawns first <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33079,31389,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33079, 31389, 7)</a>, then <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33235,31430,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33235, 31430, 7)</a> and finally <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33315,31452,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33315, 31452, 7)</a> after 5, 18 and 30 of the raid announcement.</li>\n<li>During an unannounced, small raid around <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33296,31459,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this camp (33296, 31459, 7)</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt behaves in the same way as an <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Marauder\">Orc Marauder</a>.<br/><br/>Cublarc the Plunderer attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tBe careful when facing this creature because it spawns with many others. The strategy is the same as an <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Marauder\">Orc Marauder</a>. Remember that they only appear during a raid so kill it fast, make sure you have enough supplies with you because the real problem are the <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Marauder\">Orc Marauders</a> that appear with him. Try not to lure the other orcs or you may die quickly.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 171 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-85</td>\n<td>7.3</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"53.801170\" style=\"text-align:center;\">54%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.26</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"26.315789\" style=\"text-align:center;\">26%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.21</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"21.052632\" style=\"text-align:center;\">21%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shaggy Tail\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shaggy_Tail_e2eed7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Shaggy Tail</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Check Mark\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Check_Mark_b3619b.gif\" width=